// reference's own test of the same boot (vcard/t_vcard_amdev.py: A cold, C warm through mode1, P PMFW alive/dead/hung, D POST resets BAR0,
// E RAS boot config) plus what the driver adds (already-up card, failure handling) and the boot-memory addresses.
// Build/run: see mi50-tools/build_and_test.sh.
